<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" dir="ltr">

<head>
  <%- include("../components/seo-head", {
    title: "About DevHub — Discover, Review, and Share Open-Source Projects",
    description: "DevHub is a community-driven platform for discovering, reviewing, and sharing open-source projects. Ratings, satisfaction scores, and real feedback — not just GitHub stars.",
    canonicalPath: "/about",
    keywords: "about DevHub, open source, developer platform, software discovery, project reviews, GitHub alternative",
    ogType: "website",
    extraStyles: ["/styles/about.css"],
    jsonLd: {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "AboutPage",
      "name": "About DevHub",
      "description": "DevHub is a platform for discovering, reviewing, and sharing open-source projects.",
      "url": "/about",
      "mainEntity": {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "name": "DevHub",
        "description": "A community-driven platform for discovering and reviewing open-source projects.",
        "sameAs": []
      }
    }
  }) %>
</head>

<body>
  <%- include("../components/header") %>

  <main class="about-page">

    <!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
    <section class="about-hero">
      <div class="about-hero__glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="about-hero__inner">
        <span class="about-hero__badge">Open-source discovery, reimagined</span>

        <h1 class="about-hero__title">About DevHub</h1>

        <p class="about-hero__lead">
          DevHub is a community-driven platform for
          <strong>discovering, reviewing, and sharing</strong>
          open-source projects. It brings the discovery experience of
          GitHub and Product Hunt together, focusing on real project
          quality and honest feedback rather than star counts alone.
        </p>

        <div class="about-hero__cta">
          <a href="/explore" class="btn-primary">
            Explore Projects
          </a>
          <a href="/projects" class="btn-outline">
            Browse the Catalog
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ WHY DEVHUB ============ -->
    <section class="about-section">
      <header class="about-section__head">
        <h2 class="about-section__title">Why DevHub exists</h2>
        <p class="about-section__sub">
          Three problems with how developers discover software today —
          and how DevHub addresses each one.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="about-cards">
        <article class="about-card">
          <div class="about-card__icon" style="--c:#6ebbff" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle>
              <line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"></line>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="about-card__title">Stars are a poor signal</h3>
          <p class="about-card__body">
            A project can gather thousands of stars and still be
            abandoned, poorly documented, or hard to integrate. DevHub
            surfaces signals that reflect actual usability — ratings
            from real users, satisfaction levels, and long-form reviews.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="about-card">
          <div class="about-card__icon" style="--c:#a78bfa" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="about-card__title">Feedback gets lost</h3>
          <p class="about-card__body">
            Issues and discussions on repository platforms often bury
            user experience in technical threads. DevHub provides a
            dedicated space for structured feedback — ratings, reviews,
            and threaded comments that stay attached to the project.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="about-card">
          <div class="about-card__icon" style="--c:#34d399" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
              <circle cx="8.5" cy="8.5" r="1.5"></circle>
              <polyline points="21 15 16 10 5 21"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="about-card__title">Everything is scattered</h3>
          <p class="about-card__body">
            Demos live on one platform, downloads on another,
            documentation somewhere else. DevHub consolidates
            screenshots, demo videos, downloadable releases, and
            Markdown documentation into one coherent project page.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ AUDIENCE ============ -->
    <section class="about-section">
      <header class="about-section__head">
        <h2 class="about-section__title">Who DevHub is for</h2>
        <p class="about-section__sub">
          Whether you are building, publishing, or simply exploring —
          DevHub is designed to help.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="about-audience">
        <article class="about-audience__item">
          <div class="about-audience__badge" aria-hidden="true">01</div>
          <h3 class="about-audience__title">Developers</h3>
          <p class="about-audience__body">
            Avoid reinventing the wheel. Before starting a new project,
            discover similar work, compare approaches, and learn from
            what the community has already built.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="about-audience__item">
          <div class="about-audience__badge" aria-hidden="true">02</div>
          <h3 class="about-audience__title">Project owners</h3>
          <p class="about-audience__body">
            Receive structured feedback that goes beyond a star count.
            Understand what users value, what needs improvement, and
            increase your project's visibility among the right audience.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="about-audience__item">
          <div class="about-audience__badge" aria-hidden="true">03</div>
          <h3 class="about-audience__title">Explorers</h3>
          <p class="about-audience__body">
            Discover useful tools, creative ideas, and high-quality
            projects you would otherwise miss. Every listing is curated
            through community ratings and reviews.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ FEATURES ============ -->
    <section class="about-section">
      <header class="about-section__head">
        <h2 class="about-section__title">Core features</h2>
        <p class="about-section__sub">
          What you get on every project page.
        </p>
      </header>

      <ul class="about-features">
        <li class="about-feature">
          <span class="about-feature__icon" aria-hidden="true">🔄</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Automatic GitHub synchronization</strong>
            <span>Stars, forks, language, and license are kept up to date.</span>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li class="about-feature">
          <span class="about-feature__icon" aria-hidden="true">⭐</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Reviews with ratings and satisfaction scores</strong>
            <span>Rate out of five and indicate how satisfied you actually were.</span>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li class="about-feature">
          <span class="about-feature__icon" aria-hidden="true">💬</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Nested comments and threaded discussions</strong>
            <span>Follow conversations without losing context.</span>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li class="about-feature">
          <span class="about-feature__icon" aria-hidden="true">🔥</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Hot Score–based discovery</strong>
            <span>Trending projects are ranked by engagement, not raw popularity.</span>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li class="about-feature">
          <span class="about-feature__icon" aria-hidden="true">🏷️</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Tags and categories</strong>
            <span>Find related projects through a consistent taxonomy.</span>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li class="about-feature">
          <span class="about-feature__icon" aria-hidden="true">🎥</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Rich project pages</strong>
            <span>Screenshots, demo videos, downloadable releases, and Markdown docs.</span>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ CALL TO ACTION ============ -->
    <section class="about-cta">
      <div class="about-cta__inner">
        <h2 class="about-cta__title">Ready to explore?</h2>
        <p class="about-cta__sub">
          Start discovering open-source projects, or publish your own
          and start receiving feedback.
        </p>

        <div class="about-cta__actions">
          <a href="/explore" class="btn-primary">Start Exploring</a>
          <a href="/dashboard/projects" class="btn-outline">Publish a Project</a>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn-ghost">Contact Us</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <%- include("../components/footer") %>
</body>

</html>